{% filter trim %}
{% if not axes %}
No objective axes are configured. Use objectives.toml to enable multi-objective checkpoint retention; official scalar tracking remains active.
{% else %}
Configured axes: {% for axis in axes %}{{ axis.name }}:{{ axis.direction }}{{ ", " if not loop.last else "" }}{% endfor +%}
Dominance is variance-aware: a point removes another only when it is no worse within {{ noise }} on every axis and better by more than {{ noise }} on at least one.
{% endif %}
{% if latest is none %}
Latest completed round: none.
{% else %}
Latest completed round: round {{ latest.round_number }}, commit {{ (latest.commit or "(missing)")[:12] }}, official metrics: {{ latest.metrics }}; retained: {{ latest.retained }}.
{% endif %}
