{% if frontier_recorded %}
Trusted frontier parents:
{% for point in frontier %}
- round {{ point.round_number }}, commit {{ point.commit[:12] }}, {{ "official" if point.official else "reviewed provisional" }}: {{ point.metrics }}; operating point: {{ point.operating_point or "canonical workload row" }}; artifact: {{ point.artifact or "(missing)" }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Trusted frontier parents: none recorded yet.
{% endif %}
{% if pending %}
Measured frontier claims not yet usable as trusted parents (retain the commit, but do not treat it as a parent). A row lands here because its hard invariants have not passed independent review, or because its numbers are the implementer's own report rather than a framework measurement:
{% if omitted %}
- {{ omitted.count }} older untrusted {{ "claim" if omitted.count == 1 else "claims" }} omitted from this context ({{ "round %d" | format(omitted.first_round) if omitted.first_round == omitted.last_round else "rounds %d-%d" | format(omitted.first_round, omitted.last_round) }}); do not treat any omitted claim as a trusted parent.
{% endif %}
{% for claim in pending %}
- round {{ claim.round_number }}, commit {{ claim.commit[:12] }}: {{ claim.metrics }}; operating point: {{ claim.operating_point or "(unspecified)" }}; artifact: {{ claim.artifact or "(missing)" }}; reason: {{ claim.reason or "(unspecified)" }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
